// # Ooda CLI QA Index — Anchor for Agents
//
// Logline: Index of the ooda self-test probe drivers.
//
// Setup: Each probe exercises one live path. If a probe fails, the ooda package fails to release.
//
// Beats:
//   1. probe_argv.oo — rest-contract parse helpers for test, gen, digest, bench, context, token.
//   2. probe_spawn.oo — OODACODEX bin path only. No PATH.
//   3. probe_api_surface.oo — 4 subdirs present. Killed files absent.
//   4. probe_fmt.oo — fmt idempotence and traversal.
//   5. probe_health.oo — context and health contracts.
//   6. probe_blackbox_e2e.oo — oodac build double-run.
//   7. probe_update.oo — update flag parse and installer trust contracts.
//   8. suite.oo runs every probe twice (CI entry).

import "suite.oo";
import "probe_argv.oo";
import "probe_spawn.oo";
import "probe_api_surface.oo";
import "probe_fmt.oo";
import "probe_health.oo";
import "probe_blackbox_e2e.oo";
import "probe_update.oo";
